{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Mole or Nothing&quot;</strong> is a deck-building, turn-based strategy game that combines resource gathering with a high-stakes game of chicken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players bring their constructed decks into the dungeon, using their cards strategically to reach the deepest depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590110/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c801?t=1772602224\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the dungeon lie various gemstones that can be collected and exchanged for gold upon returning to the surface.<br>Use the gold you\u2019ve earned to purchase stronger cards, enhance your deck, and push even further on your next descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, as turns pass, the dungeon will begin to collapse.<br>If you get caught in the collapse, you\u2019ll lose all the gemstones you\u2019ve collected\u2014so you\u2019ll need to decide when to cut your losses and return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590110/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c802?t=1772602224\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far will you go? How long will you keep gathering? When will you retreat?<br>Making the right decisions in the moment is the key to mastering the game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Escape During Collapse 5 Times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2590110/2a213124b5fb896022433539842783b7459dfcfc.jpg"},{"name":"Escape During Collapse 10 Times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2590110/55c212d348fac9ef95c8e01a65db8779230b3456.jpg"},{"name":"Escape During Collapse 15 Times","path":"ht